﻿1
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.440
Gracias.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.360
Congratulations.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.200
Um... Well...

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.280
At first

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.880
I want to say thank you guys

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.920
for being tonight here.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.080
Second, I want to say thank you

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.680
to all our employees

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.960
and our competitors.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.120
And last but not least,

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.680
I want to say thank you

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.960
to my beloved one wife, Veronica.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.720
She's my inspiration.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.840
She's my everything.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.120
I think

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.480
the most important for us is the family.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.080
Thank you guys.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.280
And there she is.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.040
My love.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:04.840
Veronica.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.320
Thank you,

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.000
darling.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.920
I've got a gift for you.
